<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>BBC Chinese</title><subtitle type="html">BBC Chinese - BBC News , 中文 - 主頁</subtitle><id>https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:55:19Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss.xml" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/trad" /><link rel="via" href="https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>習近平訪美的「僵局控管」：中美如何枱上握手、枱下算計？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckp84p0pzydgo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:55:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T00:29:23Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckp84p0pzydgo/trad--a1e97597c0be.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckp84p0pzydgo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">專家分析，美中兩國各自想要的東西不同，其中習近平更想要時間，「他一邊想盡可能獲得美國技術和市場，一邊積極降低對美國的依賴性。在這個情況下，中美彼此交易但沒有互信，追求和穩不求和解。」</summary></entry><entry><title>特朗普聯合國演說五個要點：古巴垮台、摧毀伊朗、格陵蘭基地，以及把AI改名SI</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq39myp9dm9zo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:55:16Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T04:24:56Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq39myp9dm9zo/trad--31abdf4754e7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq39myp9dm9zo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC記者團隊在周二現場採訪特朗普於聯合國的演講，並分析了當中的五個關鍵時刻。</summary></entry><entry><title>從年輕縣官到國家主席：習近平41年來的訪美影像</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T14:36:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad--63b1eb81b86b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">習近平即將到訪美國會晤特朗普（川普），這將是他歷來第11次以中國官方身份訪美。從31歲縣委書記到中國國家主席，BBC中文透過歷年照片，回顧他的訪美行程如何隨身份和中美關係變化。</summary></entry><entry><title>「雙休購」爆紅與下架：一個網購平台如何撬動勞工權益討論</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr9dw3z7v01yo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T10:03:59Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr9dw3z7v01yo/trad--b8c19d3c8d4b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr9dw3z7v01yo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">提倡雙休的民間自發平台「雙休購」曇花一現後快速被下架，中國打工人開始在社交媒體上要求雙休正當權利。學者指這樣的消費抵制是正向的發展。</summary></entry><entry><title>外星生命會讓我們生病嗎？太空微生物帶來哪些風險</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crq5xp9n7gv2o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:55:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T00:29:19Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crq5xp9n7gv2o/trad--9bbfe3670ade.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crq5xp9n7gv2o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">數十年來，我們一直在尋找地球以外的生命。然而，如果我們發現的是微生物，就必須確保它們不會令我們染病。</summary></entry><entry><title>習近平：從失去一切的「太子」到中國最有權勢的領導人</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c98r687436nvo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T02:49:58Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c98r687436nvo/trad--6cbd265bd877.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c98r687436nvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">現年73歲的習近平，早已不再是那名訪美時的縣級官員。在近14年的中國領導人任期內，他改變了中國共產黨以及這個國家在世界上的地位。</summary></entry><entry><title>香港提出「人民幣支付政府開支」為何引發「去美元化」憂慮？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c65y501pjww4o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T03:20:25Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c65y501pjww4o/trad--ae05eae289a9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c65y501pjww4o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">有經濟學者對BBC中文指出，港府希望建立「示範作用」，未來甚至「可能連收稅都收人民幣」，增加其他國家在香港使用人民幣買賣黃金、投資股票的信心。</summary></entry><entry><title>CNN 等三家美國媒體被禁入白宮後 起訴特朗普政府</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cjp30pv25xd7o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T06:52:50Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cjp30pv25xd7o/trad--ea267145f53a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cjp30pv25xd7o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">隨後，當川普前往紐約參加聯合國峰會時，美國各大電視網暫停了白宮的電視轉播。</summary></entry><entry><title>中共五中全會日期敲定 習近平政治地位新提法成看點</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6vgyzdjzl9ko/trad#1</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-21T08:49:32Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6vgyzdjzl9ko/trad--ac3b39f1c168.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6vgyzdjzl9ko/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">習近平執政後的兩次六中全會，均對其政治地位作出逐層遞進的確認。本屆五中全會同樣是黨建議題，會否出現新的提法，將是全會最值得觀察的看點。</summary></entry><entry><title>特朗普據報將赴機場迎接習近平，待遇比肩教宗和赫魯曉夫</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx980mjemv73o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-19T10:40:57Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx980mjemv73o/trad--8830b951cf8b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx980mjemv73o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國總統親赴機場迎接外國元首極為罕見。若不計教宗訪美的特例，這將是超過 60 年來美國總統首次以這種方式迎接他國元首。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國與巴基斯坦新邊界安排為何引起印度不滿？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c83v4236470lo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-21T10:22:47Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c83v4236470lo/trad--b942ac7fa3bb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c83v4236470lo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中巴邊界協議挑戰印度的領土主張，也加深了印度對喀什米爾爭議地區的戰略憂慮。</summary></entry><entry><title>莫斯科遭到烏克蘭450架無人機襲擊，市長稱規模「迄今最大」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck0j32p3el72o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-21T00:10:13Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck0j32p3el72o/trad--e3f483aac7b9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck0j32p3el72o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">莫斯科市長稱，在夜間的襲擊中，有 450 架無人機被擊落，造成兩人死亡。</summary></entry><entry><title>「運動員無法伸直雙腿睡覺」：日本亞運為何爆發住宿爭議？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckwyzg2v80elo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-18T09:24:15Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckwyzg2v80elo/trad--93b5d7958a75.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckwyzg2v80elo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">亞運選手將入住木製貨櫃屋或一艘意大利郵輪。韓國代表團批評，貨櫃屋宿舍水管漏水，且床舖太小，運動員甚至無法伸直雙腿睡覺。</summary></entry><entry><title>戴安娜弟弟出書談王室 查爾斯曾稱她「很快會被遺忘」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c80462gvk1k0o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-21T10:03:53Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c80462gvk1k0o/trad--6798bb96b1fc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c80462gvk1k0o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">戴安娜王妃逝世近30年之際，她的弟弟史賓賽伯爵出版新書，重提姐姐去世後的王室事件。他聲稱，時任王儲查爾斯曾認為戴安娜很快會被世人遺忘，但這項說法遭到王室否認。</summary></entry><entry><title>對台軍售成「特習會」談判籌碼？北京警告或取消峰會施壓特朗普</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cre30gqdn8xno/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-18T11:18:47Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cre30gqdn8xno/trad--bf4bd261b932.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cre30gqdn8xno/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中美兩國元首本月稍後預定在華府舉行的「特習會」，是全球矚目的外交焦點，中方仍未公布行程。據報北京警告若華府會前批准新一輪百億美元對台軍售，或將取消峰會。</summary></entry><entry><title>人類真的可能被AI滅絕？我們可以如何阻止？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c674k7gxpgplo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-18T09:55:28Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c674k7gxpgplo/trad--c7c731884296.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c674k7gxpgplo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">人工智能（AI）快速發展之際，AI界對其潛在風險的公開討論也越來越多。部分科學家甚至估計，未來十年AI導致人類滅絕的可能性超過一成。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國有越來越多的男性開始「厭女」嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwq63vj4q7q2o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-16T10:35:04Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwq63vj4q7q2o/trad--4909f2454858.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwq63vj4q7q2o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">這裡沒有像安德魯·泰特（Andrew Tate）那樣的網紅領導一場運動。相反地，這種挫折感散落在各個網路社群中，一些年輕男性在其中宣洩自己對戀愛以及建立家庭所需昂貴開銷的種種不滿。</summary></entry><entry><title>專訪鄧燕娥：與李卓人相伴四十年「互相撐著」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cj4jyk29dq7o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T13:23:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cj4jyk29dq7o/trad--055d61cc8ab2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cj4jyk29dq7o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">已解散的香港市民支援愛國民主運動聯合會（支聯會）被控「煽動他人顛覆國家政權」案正式宣判，前主席李卓人被定罪判刑7年。</summary></entry><entry><title>美中峰會前，蕭美琴訪歐背後的「利基」外交</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqn4k00yrpgxo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-17T00:17:16Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqn4k00yrpgxo/trad--6c87153cbaa0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqn4k00yrpgxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">但在這樣的空間中，仍浮現出一條外交路徑：交往對象既不是一個主權國家，而是一個國際組織（即歐盟）；同時也不是其行政分支，而是其立法分支（歐洲議會）。這一雙重錯位，可以找到一個不容易受到中國壓力的外交場域。</summary></entry><entry><title>當白宮舉行宴會時，台灣會出現在「菜單」上嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq62j7my13l3o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-18T00:19:45Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq62j7my13l3o/trad--d4b229a665cf.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq62j7my13l3o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">日媒稱美中峰會前，白宮若批准新的對台軍售，習近平可能不去華府。對台灣的軍售從原則如何變成交易槓桿，台灣的晶片牌仍然有效嗎？</summary></entry><entry><title>美國能在外太空部署哪些武器？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c60re4x41yejo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-16T14:57:03Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c60re4x41yejo/trad--cbe2a9f0842a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c60re4x41yejo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國的宣佈顯示，地球軌道上的嶄新現代戰爭領域正在發展。</summary></entry><entry><title>人工智能踩「剎車」？特朗普：別忘了中美競爭</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/clyrkq2ew44o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-14T06:43:31Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/clyrkq2ew44o/trad--abfd280f0f97.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/clyrkq2ew44o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">上星期六，達里奧·阿摩迪（Dario Amodei）呼籲放緩發展步伐,以「降低出現嚴重問題的風險」，奧特曼和馬斯克均表示認同。這名Anthropic行政總裁同時強調，任何放緩都必須有所限度，以免讓中國反超領先。</summary></entry><entry><title>美軍航母全數撤離印太：台灣該擔心「空窗期」嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c87v33gxr01o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-08T06:35:07Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c87v33gxr01o/trad--6657e14d6610.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c87v33gxr01o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">專家稱，航母給美國盟友的是心理保證。印太區域沒有航母，「會加強一種整體感覺：美國正被中東局勢分心。」</summary></entry><entry><title>霍爾木茲海峽動盪，如何在巴拿馬運河引發中美角力？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cdj013krm3no/trad#3</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-08-21T13:39:35Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cdj013krm3no/trad--77ccfd7692d6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cdj013krm3no/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國和中國再次就巴拿馬運河問題交鋒。這條戰略水道約佔全球海運貿易量5%，而美國近40%的集裝箱運輸都經過這裏。</summary></entry><entry><title>專家評中國修《國防動員法》：吸俄烏教訓實現「平戰快速轉換」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c4gr202jdzpo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-14T00:19:09Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c4gr202jdzpo/trad--216c74954be4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c4gr202jdzpo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">新法還首次明定，18至60歲男性、18至55歲女性原則上須擔負國防勤務；金融、交通、電信、能源、醫療、糧食等關鍵領域，在動員期間均可採取特別措施。</summary></entry><entry><title>星宇股份解約風波：107名應屆生「告洋狀」揭示中國勞工維權現狀</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c4gkqekn7q7o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-15T00:17:18Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c4gkqekn7q7o/trad--8a55aafaa223.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c4gkqekn7q7o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">9月9日，就近期在中國引起轟動的「星宇股份解約107位應屆生」事件，上交所向星宇股份下發監管工作函，港交所延緩其上市審核，此前，公司董事長周曉萍已公開道歉。</summary></entry><entry><title>威爾士、蘇格蘭和北愛爾蘭一起要「公投權」英國是否面臨分裂？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c85yd2dnw25vo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-15T07:37:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c85yd2dnw25vo/trad--8f9d367605db.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c85yd2dnw25vo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">威爾斯黨、蘇格蘭民族黨和新芬黨的領導人表示，英國政府應該為憲政改革做好準備。</summary></entry><entry><title>俄烏戰場為何或會迎來新一批朝鮮軍人</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr7dl0n178do/trad#4</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-14T11:25:51Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr7dl0n178do/trad--bb5c4cb43663.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr7dl0n178do/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">朝鮮（北韓）士兵於2024年底被平壤派遣，與俄羅斯部隊並肩作戰，試圖擊退烏克蘭的一次攻勢。烏克蘭總統澤連斯基表示，俄羅斯沃羅涅日地區正進行準備，以接收新一批朝鮮部隊。</summary></entry><entry><title>董建華逝世：從船王富二代到香港首任特首，中共的「親密朋友」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx2yn54wn4eo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-09T09:29:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx2yn54wn4eo/trad--7c9b72110192.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx2yn54wn4eo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中國全國政協前副主席，香港首任特首董建華逝世，享年89歲。他的前半生見證主權移交前香港的東方之珠年代，後半生更走入最高行政當局左右香港的前途。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國強勢下，歐洲電池工業謀求「重新充電」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cn8ex870p05o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-14T00:19:18Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cn8ex870p05o/trad--fa0b5dd070c0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cn8ex870p05o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">歐洲擁有一些前景可期的電池技術，但它能否追回被中國電池巨頭拉開的差距？</summary></entry><entry><title>習近平七年再訪印度：金磚峰會握手背後，中印關係破冰？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cg7knkpjr39o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-13T10:56:43Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cg7knkpjr39o/trad--f490ef71bcd9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cg7knkpjr39o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">金磚峰會《新德里宣言》呼籲對伊朗戰爭「最大克制」卻不點名美國。而習近平七年首訪印度，中印關係解凍了嗎？</summary></entry><entry><title>香港支聯會「煽動顛覆」案：被告們的伴侶與戰友</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq63868gq5qo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T13:23:08Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq63868gq5qo/trad--ca085d2d883b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq63868gq5qo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">香港支聯會「煽顛」案歷經五年，三名核心人物的判刑結果塵埃落定。BBC中文訪問李卓人的妻子鄧燕娥及鄒幸彤戰友劉家儀，講述他們如何面對香港的變遷和怎樣陪伴在牆內的人。</summary></entry><entry><title>2026台灣地方選舉：「九合一」為何重要？選舉時程是什麼？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp931k7xx4do/trad#5</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-16T04:47:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp931k7xx4do/trad--d50ebbd623d5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp931k7xx4do/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">台灣的地方選舉又稱「九合一」選舉，每四年一次，多數落在總統任期中段的年底，故被視為總統的「期中考」。</summary></entry><entry><title>AI「性轉」視頻風靡中國網絡：一場「 新文化運動」的覺醒與侷限</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cn74d8mr640o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-10T00:14:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cn74d8mr640o/trad--f99eecee7c89.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cn74d8mr640o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">經典的「好太太」系列廣告以「好丈夫」的形象重出江湖：鏡頭前穿著清涼的不再是女性,而是男性。</summary></entry><entry><title>領英高層分享6個人脈竅門，幫你更快找到工作</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63rezxeyw9qo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-17T09:48:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63rezxeyw9qo/trad--e3616c6e04f5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63rezxeyw9qo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從咖啡閒聊到領英訊息，以下是如何透過人脈關係找到下一份工作的方法。</summary></entry><entry><title>「我接受了11年化療，卻發現從未患癌」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm62eve2y6xeo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-16T00:18:50Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm62eve2y6xeo/trad--c278cc5b12f2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm62eve2y6xeo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">貝姬·瓊斯（Becky Jones）21歲被告知患有末期腦癌，接受了長達11年的化療，近期才發現根本不是癌症。和她有類似經歷的，還有同一間醫院的另外40多名病患。</summary></entry><entry><title>協助死亡：世界各地法律有何不同</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0lr7lx49l8o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-14T08:19:35Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0lr7lx49l8o/trad--96fcfcf8ead4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0lr7lx49l8o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">全球約有4億人可以獲得某種形式的協助死亡（安樂死）服務，這些國家的政策都是怎樣的？</summary></entry><entry><title>《匹茲堡醫魂》拿走了六個艾美獎，它的忠粉都是真醫生</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmvgyn5gywz1o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-15T15:23:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmvgyn5gywz1o/trad--e7292bfa9860.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmvgyn5gywz1o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">醫療專業人士表示，這部講述美國醫院急症室的 HBO Max 劇集，是迄今最真實的一部醫療劇。</summary></entry><entry><title>女性比男性更擅長耐力跑嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0m34g3v7zjo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-13T02:47:42Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0m34g3v7zjo/trad--6fce54d2002f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0m34g3v7zjo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">近月來，女性在多項備受矚目的耐力賽事中擊敗男性對手。她們是否天生更適合這類挑戰？</summary></entry></feed>
